decision_conditions:
Condition : 6 - The use hereby permitted for a Children's Centre shall not be carried on outside the following times; 
9am to 5pm Monday to Friday, except on no more than a total of two weekdays per month, when only the following uses within Use Class D1 may be carried on from 5pm to 9pm;
(i) Meeting hall for community groups
	(ii) Non-residential education and training
No use is permitted on weekends, Public Holidays or Bank Holidays.
